&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead a team of 6 to 7 engineers&lt;/strong&gt; of mixed seniority, owning delivery, quality and production health end to end — keeping engagement high and standards higher&lt;/li&gt;
